<h1 style="font-size:2rem;font-weight:800;">Social Link Previews</h1>
<p>Control how your short links appear when shared on WhatsApp, Facebook, Twitter, Slack, Discord, LinkedIn, and Telegram.</p>

<h2>How It Works</h2>
<p>When you set a <strong>Custom Title</strong>, <strong>Description</strong>, or <strong>Image</strong> on a link, UTMPro serves special HTML with Open Graph meta tags to social media bots. Regular users still get a fast 302 redirect.</p>

<h2>Setting Custom Previews</h2>
<ol><li>Create or edit a link</li><li>Fill in the <strong>Custom Title</strong> field</li><li>Add a <strong>Custom Description</strong></li><li>Set a <strong>Custom Image URL</strong> (recommended: 1200×630px)</li><li>Save the link</li></ol>

<h2>Auto-Fetch</h2>
<p>When you paste a destination URL, UTMPro automatically fetches the page's existing OG tags. You can use these as-is or customize them.</p>

<h2>Supported Platforms</h2>
<ul><li>WhatsApp</li><li>Facebook / Messenger</li><li>Twitter / X</li><li>LinkedIn</li><li>Slack</li><li>Discord</li><li>Telegram</li></ul>
